<title>USA: US stocks open mixed,blue chips up but techs off.</title>
<headline>US stocks open mixed,blue chips up but techs off.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened mixed on Tuesday, with blue chip stocks moving higher but technology stocks hurt by the release of weak earnings at Hewlett-Packard. Bonds strong after release of weak October housing starts.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials index rose 20 at 6,367 and the long bond rose 12/32 to yield 6.44 percent.</p>
